---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BlockButton from '../components/BlockButton.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Contact | Mind, Brain, Behavior Society"
  description="Reach the Mind, Brain, Behavior Society: officer emails, Instagram, and how professors can offer a lab tour or guest lecture."
  path="/contact"
>
  <main class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-title">Contact</h1>

    <p>Questions, new-member inquiries, and anything else:</p>
    <ul class="contacts">
      <li>Luca Gandrud, President: <a href="mailto:luca.d.gandrud.27@dartmouth.edu">luca.d.gandrud.27@dartmouth.edu</a></li>
      <li>Crystal Ye, Vice President: <a href="mailto:crystal.ye.27@dartmouth.edu">crystal.ye.27@dartmouth.edu</a></li>
      <li>Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/dartmouth.mbb">@dartmouth.mbb</a></li>
    </ul>
    <p>New members are always welcome, and we're happy to walk you through how to get involved.</p>
    <p class="cta"><BlockButton href="mailto:luca.d.gandrud.27@dartmouth.edu">Email the president</BlockButton></p>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-h">For professors and researchers</h2>
      <p>
        If you'd like to host a lab tour, give a guest lecture, or take on undergraduate
        researchers, email either officer above.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section-h">Get involved</h2>
      <p>
        Come to an event (see the <a href="/calendar">term calendar</a>), or email us.
        Applications for the neurotech team open periodically (see the
        <a href="/neurotech">neurotech page</a>).
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .contacts {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-block: var(--s3);
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  .contacts li { padding-block: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .contacts li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--ink); }
  .cta { margin-top: var(--s4); }
</style>
